# WeatherChangeEvent と ThunderChangeEvent。天気の切り替え直前。

file: net/minecraft/world/level/storage/PrimaryLevelData.java
anchor:
    public void setThundering(boolean thundering) {
insert-after:
    if (!dev.shifu.event.ShifuEvents.thunderChange(this.getLevelName(), thundering)) {
        return;
    }

